    "A successful empty service-principal reply on the checked W32Time pipe selects a null SSPI target. Any failed query remains fatal.",
    "The native target belongs to the checked reply, independent of inherited GSSAPI context. Named replies preserve their supplied target.",
    "Packet privacy, replay and sequence protection, caller identification, peer checks, byte bounds, and cleanup remain mandatory.",
    "Windows CI runs mandatory service and SSPI checks before the full runtime suite. No skip or failure bypass is added."
